sector, giving investors a better understanding of business conditions and valuable information about the economic backdrop of various markets.^This data is valuable for policymakers and business leaders to understand the market conditions and helps in formulating economic policies or business strategies."},{"question":"How to interpret the Services Purchasing Managers Index (PMI) indicator?","answer":"The PMI is typically measured on a scale from 0 to 100. An index value above 50 indicates that the service sector is generally expanding. The higher the number (above 50), the stronger the expansion. Conversely, a value below 50 suggests a contraction in the service sector. The lower the number (below 50), the greater the degree of contraction.^A consistently high PMI can indicate robust services sector growth, while a low PMI may point to a downturn."}],"related":[{"slug":"baltic-dry-index","title":"Baltic Dry Index"},{"slug":"bank-credit-services","title":"Bank Credit - Services"},{"slug":"consumer-price-index-cpi-inflation-miscellaneous","title":"Consumer Price Index (CPI) Inflation - Miscellaneous"},{"slug":"domestic-air-passenger-traffic","title":"Air Passenger Traffic - Domestic"},{"slug":"domestic-passenger-car-sales","title":"Domestic Passenger Car Sales"},{"slug":"epfo-additions","title":"EPFO Payroll Additions"},{"slug":"goods-and-services-tax-gst-collections","title":"GST Collections"},{"slug":"government-capital-expenditure","title":"Government Capital Expenditure"},{"slug":"gross-tax-revenue","title":"Gross Tax Revenue"},{"slug":"international-air-passenger-traffic","title":"Air Passenger Traffic - International"},{"slug":"mgnrega-work-demanded","title":"MGNREGA Work Demand"},{"slug":"port-cargo-traffic","title":"Port Cargo Traffic"},{"slug":"revenue-earnings-railway-freight-traffic-major-commodities","title":"Railway Freight Traffic- Revenue"},{"slug":"services-business-confidence","title":"Services Business Confidence"},{"slug":"services-trade-net-inflows","title":"Services Trade- Net Inflows"},{"slug":"two-wheeler-sales","title":"Domestic Two-Wheeler Sales"}],"title":"HSBC Services PMI","description":"India's services PMI stands at 55.2 for Sep 2026. Services make up over half of India's economy, making this an early growth signal.","headline":{"Absolute":"India's services PMI stands at 55.2 for Sep 2026. Services make up over half of India's economy, making this an early growth signal."},"source":"CMIE Economic Outlook, 1 Finance Research","source_url":"https://economicoutlook.cmie.com/","date_modified":"2026-09-01","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T15:27:35+00:00"}